0\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 Cardiac silhouette  appars triangular in shape and \\plain\\f4\\fs24  Mildly enlarged with \\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 elevation of the cardiac apex\\plain\\f4\\fs24 .\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 The main and \\plain\\f4\\fs24  \\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 central pulmonary arteries appear prominent \\plain\\f4\\fs24  with relative \\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 pruning of peripheral vessels\\plain\\f4\\fs24 , suggestive of increased pulmonary arterial pressure.otherwise \\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 Lung fields are \\plain\\f4\\fs24 Clear, without focal consolidation or pleural effusion.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}} Both Costophrenic angles are clear\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}};bony thorax unremarkable.\\par\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24\\b\\ul Impression:\\plain\\f4\\fs24\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 Radiographic features consistent with pulmonary arterial hypertension\\plain\\f4\\fs24  (PAH): elevated cardiac apex with enlarged central pulmonary vessels.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs19\\f4\\fs24 Correlation with echocardiography and clinical assessment recommended\\plain\\f4\\fs24  for confirmation and severity assessment.\\par\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\li720\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f1\\fs24\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\tx10800\\tx11520\\tx12240\\tx12960\\tx13680\\tx14400 Thanks for the referral,\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f5\\fs22\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:24');
