n\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf4\\pnfs22\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}There is smooth flow of barium from the anus to the descending colon. \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f4\\fs22\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\qj\\fi-360\\li1080\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1080\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf4\\pnfs22\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}Contrast is filled in the rectum, anal canal and the rectosigmoid junction which appears normal. \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f4\\fs22\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf4\\pnfs22\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}Air filled descending colon and transverse colon is seen. \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f4\\fs22\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li1080\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1080\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf4\\pnfs22\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}No obstructive lesion seen.\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\qj\\li576\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx450\\tx576\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\plain\\f3\\fs22\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\par\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs22\\b\\ul CONCLUSION:\\plain\\f2\\fs22\\b  Barium meal shows\\loch\\f2\\hich\\f2\\\'85.\\par\\par\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f4\\fs22\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li1080\\tx720\\tx1080\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\ls2\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls2\\pnstart1\\pnf4\\pnfs22\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}No significant abnormality of note. \\par\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\tx10800\\tx11520\\tx12240\\tx12960\\tx13680\\tx14400\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\b\\cf3\\par\\par\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\cf3 Please correlate clinically.\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24 Thanks for the referral,\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:25');
