\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}There is no evidence of any abnormal radio opacity in the region of both kidneys, pelvi ureteric regions and urinary bladder.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf3\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}Both kidneys show a prompt excretion of the intravenously injected contrast.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf3\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}Both kidneys are normal in size, shape, position and contour.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf3\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}The intrarenal calyces show normal morphology. There is no evidence of mass effect or indentation on the calyces. There is no evidence of focaly caliectasis or hydronephrosis.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf3\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}Both ureters show adequate opacification and appear normal in course. There is no evidence of hydroureter.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf3\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}The urinary bladder is adequately distended and shows a normal contour. There is no evidence of any significant post void residual urine.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf3\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}The visualized lumbar vertebrae appear unremarkable.\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\sa200\\sl276\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\ul IMPRESSION:\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b  The I.V.U. study shows,\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f3\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\widctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sa200\\sl276\\slmult1\\tx360\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\ls2\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls2\\pnstart1\\pnf3\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}No significant abnormality of note.\\par\\pard\\s18\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\tx10800\\tx11520\\tx12240\\tx12960\\tx13680\\tx14400\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\cf3 Please correlate clinically.\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24 Thanks for the referral,\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\tab\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:25');
