cf10\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9\\fi-360\\li3240}}\\ls2}}\r\n{\\*\\generator TX_RTF32 16.0.533.500;}\r\n\\deftab1134\\paperw12000\\paperh15840\\margl1440\\margt1440\\margr1440\\margb1440\\widowctrl\\formshade\\sectd\r\n\\headery720\\footery720\\pgwsxn12240\\pghsxn15840\\marglsxn1440\\margtsxn1440\\margrsxn1440\\margbsxn1440\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\qc\\sl276\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\ul X-RAY OF LUMBAR SPINE ( AP AND LATERAL VIEW )\\par\\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\qj\\li720\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\qj\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080 Straightening of the lumbar spine is seen suggestive of muscle spasm.\\par Disc spaces are maintained.\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\sl276\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f1\\fs28 Pre vertebral soft tissue is unremarkable.\\par Both S-I joints are normal.\\par\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\qj\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\cf5 Sacralisation of L5 vertebra is seen on right side .\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\i\\cf6\\cb7\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat7 unfused posterior laminae of L5 - vertebrae is seen .\\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi45\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\ul CONCLUSION:\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b  \\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sl276\\slmult1\\tx4680\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\tx10800\\tx11520\\tx12240\\tx12960\\tx13680\\tx14400  \\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\i\\cf3   Hemisacralisation of L5 vertebra ,rt \\par\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs22\\b\\i SPINA BIFIDA OCCULTA \\plain\\f2\\fs22\\cf5\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb60\\sa120\\plain\\f2\\fs26\\b\\cf8\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9 Lumbarization of S1\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb60\\sa90\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf8\\pncb9{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\cf6\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9 assimilation of S1 to lumbar spine\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf6\\pncb9{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}less common than sacralization, occurring in ~2% of the population\\loch\\f5\\hich\\f5\\~\\plain\\f5\\fs18\\cf6\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9\\up6 2\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\cf6\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf6\\pncb9{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}presence of six rib-free lumbar-type vertebrae, which may have the following features:\\par{\\listtext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li720\\sb60\\sa90\\tx720\\ls1\\ilvl1\\plain\\cs22\\f5\\fs24\\cf10\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9 squaring\\loch\\f5\\hich\\f5\\~\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\cf6\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9 of highest sacral (transitional) vertebral body\\par{\\listtext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li720\\sb60\\sa90\\tx720\\ls2\\ilvl1 facet joints (even though rudimentary) and intervertebral disc at S1-S2\\par\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb60\\sa120\\plain\\f2\\fs26\\b\\cf8\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9 Sacralization of L5\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb60\\sa90\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf8\\pncb9{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\cf6\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9 assimilation of L5 to the sacrum\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf6\\pncb9{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}more common than lumbarization, occurring in ~17% of the population\\loch\\f5\\hich\\f5\\~\\plain\\f5\\fs18\\cf6\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9\\up6 2\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\cf6\\cb9\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat9\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf6\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf6\\pncb9{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}presence of four rib-free lumbar type vertebrae, which may have the following features:\\par{\\listtext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li720\\sb60\\sa90\\tx720\\ls2\\ilvl1 wedging of the lowest lumbar (transitional) vertebral body\\par{\\listtext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls2\\ilvl1 broadened transverse processes, potentially with pseudoarticulation or fusion with one or both sacral ala\\par{\\listtext\\pard\\plain\\f6\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls2\\ilvl1 hypoplastic or absent facet joints or intervertebral disc at L5-S1\\par\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f5\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:25');
