tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\qj\\sl276\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\tab\\tab Suggestive of congestive heart failure  \\par\\par\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\fi-2250\\li2250\\sl480\\slmult1\\tx1800\\tx2250\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\tx10800\\plain\\f6\\fs22\\b Heart\\tab :\\tab\\plain\\f6\\fs22 Mildly enlarged in transverse diameter with enlarged pulmonary artery and increased pulmonary vascukarity ..\\par\\tab\\tab\\par\\tab\\tab Small aortic knuckle \\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\fi-2250\\li2250\\sl480\\slmult1\\tx576\\tx1800\\tx2250\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f6\\fs22\\b Impression\\tab :Findings are suggestive of  congenital heart disease ? ASD \\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\qj\\sl276\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f1\\fs24\\b  Suggest follow up.\\par\\plain\\f1\\fs24 P\\plain\\cs22\\f1\\fs24 lease correlate clinically.\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\fi-2250\\li2250\\sl480\\slmult1\\tx576\\tx1800\\tx2250\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f6\\fs22\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:25');
