acement of the humeral head with respect to the glenoid (losing the half-moon overlap). \\par Half moon sign ..POSTERIOR DISLOCATION OF SHOULDER JOINT \\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\widctlpar\\sl480\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f6\\fs22 No evidence of any bony lesion or joint abnormality is \\par noted in the bones forming the right shoulder joint.\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\sl480\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f6\\fs22\\b AC Joint space is widened with overlying soft tissue swelling.\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\fi-90\\li540\\tx540\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\plain\\f6\\fs20\\b\\ul\\par\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f6\\fs22 Impression\\tab : Subluxation of AC Joint.\\par\\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f8\\fs28  well defined centric osteolytic lesion is seen in proximal humeral meta diaphysis .\\par   Joint spaces are maintained.\\par Soft tissue is unremarkable.\\par No restricted movement is noted in the abduction view .\\par\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f8\\fs32\\b\\ul COMMENT\\plain\\f8\\fs32\\b : Lytic lesion in proximal humerus ? SBC .\\par\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\par\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\b CLINICOPATHOLOGICAL CORRELATION IS ADVISED \\par\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:25');
