p0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f5\\fs22\\par\\pard\\s17\\itap0\\keepn\\widctlpar\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\ul RT   LT  WRIST JOINT B/V: \\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\plain\\f7\\fs28\\b\\i\\ul Findings\\plain\\f7\\fs28\\b :\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs28\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs28\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f5\\fs36\\cf3\\cb5\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat5 A fracture with an offset of 2 mm or more in any plane or 2 mm offset involving the articular surface is considered displaced.Displacement can be dorsal, volar, radial or proximal.\\plain\\f4\\fs36  \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs36\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\ls2\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls2\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs36\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f5\\fs32\\cf3\\cb5\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat5\\loch\\f5\\hich\\f5\\~fracture is transverse (good prognosis), oblique or comminuted (multifragmented).\\plain\\f4\\fs32\\line\\plain\\f5\\fs32\\cf3\\cb5\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat5 When a fracture is oblique or when it is comminuted with crossing of the mid axial line, it can be unstable.\\plain\\f4\\fs32  \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs32\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls2\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls2\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs32\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f5\\fs32\\cf3\\cb5\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat5 The radial shortening results in the ulna abutting the lunate.\\plain\\f4\\fs32\\line\\plain\\f5\\fs32\\cf3\\cb5\\chshdng0\\chcfpat0\\chcbpat5 Notice the loss of radiocarpal joint space indicating osteoarthritis.\\plain\\f4\\fs32  \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs32\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\ls3\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls3\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs32\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\plain\\f8\\fs24\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls4\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls4\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f4\\fs24 The fracture shows \\plain\\cs21\\f4\\fs24 bending deformity\\plain\\f4\\fs24  with \\plain\\cs21\\f4\\fs24 incomplete cortical break along the dorsal aspect of the distal radius\\plain\\f4\\fs24 ,and \\plain\\cs21\\f4\\fs24 intact cortex on the opposite side\\plain\\f4\\fs24 , typical of paediatric Greenstick injury.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls5\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls5\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f9\\fs24\\b There is a transverse extraarticular  noted through the distal radiual   and ulnar  metaphysis   \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls5\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls5\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}The \\plain\\cs21\\f9\\fs24\\b distal fragment is dorsally displaced and dorsally angulated\\plain\\f9\\fs24\\b , producing a \\plain\\cs21\\f9\\fs24\\b classic \\loch\\f9\\hich\\f9\\\'93dinner fork\\\'94 deformity.\\plain\\f9\\fs24\\b\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls5\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls5\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs21\\f9\\fs24\\b mild radial shortening\\plain\\f9\\fs24\\b  present.\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\plain\\f7\\fs28 Fracture is seen at the distal end of  radius  and ulna \\par\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb100\\sa100\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080 Joint spaces are normal. \\plain\\f8\\fs24\\par\\plain\\f7\\fs28 Soft tissue swelling noted around the fracture site.\\plain\\f8\\fs24\\par\\plain\\f7\\fs28\\b\\i\\ul Impression\\plain\\f7\\fs28\\b : \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls4\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls4\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f7\\fs28 Fracture  at the distal end of  radius  and ulna \\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb93\\sa186\\tx360\\ls5\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls5\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs21\\f4\\fs24\\b\\i Greenstick fracture of the distal radius\\plain\\f1\\fs28\\b\\i  \\plain\\f8\\fs24\\b\\ul\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f10\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\tx360\\ls5\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls5\\pnstart1\\pnf10\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnul\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs21\\f4\\fs24\\b Extra-articular Colles\\loch\\f4\\hich\\f4\\\'92 fracture of the distal radius\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\tx360\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:25');
