\tx10080\\plain\\f1\\fs32\\b\\ul  shoulder joint B/V:\\par\\plain\\f1\\fs28 Degenerative changes are seen in the articular margins of bones forming the  shoulder joint \\par\\pard\\itap0\\widctlpar\\sl360\\slmult1\\tx720\\tx1440\\tx2160\\tx2880\\tx3600\\tx4320\\tx5040\\tx5760\\tx6480\\tx7200\\tx7920\\tx8640\\tx9360\\tx10080 Joint spaces are maintained.\\par Soft tissue is unremarkable.\\par No restricted movement is noted in the abduction view .\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f0\\fs32\\b\\ul COMMENT\\plain\\f0\\fs32\\b : Degenerative changes .\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\plain\\f4\\fs24 There is evidence of \\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 degenerative changes\\plain\\f4\\fs24  involving the glenohumeral and acromioclavicular joints.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Joint space\\plain\\f4\\fs24 : Narrowed at the glenohumeral joint, indicating cartilage loss.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Subchondral bone\\plain\\f4\\fs24 : Shows sclerosis and small cystic changes at the articular margins of the humeral head and glenoid cavity.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Osteophytes\\plain\\f4\\fs24 : Marginal osteophyte formation seen along the humeral head and inferior glenoid rim.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Acromioclavicular joint\\plain\\f4\\fs24 : Shows joint space narrowing with marginal osteophytes and sclerosis.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Greater tuberosity\\plain\\f4\\fs24 : Shows \\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 irregularity, sclerosis, and cortical roughening\\plain\\f4\\fs24 , suggestive of chronic \\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 degenerative enthesopathic changes\\plain\\f4\\fs24  at the rotator cuff tendon insertion (often due to chronic tendinopathy).\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 No acute fracture or dislocation\\plain\\f4\\fs24  noted.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Soft tissues\\plain\\f4\\fs24  appear unremarkable, with no calcific deposits seen\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}.\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24\\b\\i\\ul Impression:\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\plain\\f4\\fs24\\line\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\ls2\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls2\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Degenerative osteoarthritic changes of the right shoulder joint\\plain\\f4\\fs24  involving both the glenohumeral and acromioclavicular joints.\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f7\\fs24\\\'b7\\tab}\\ls2\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls2\\pnstart1\\pnf7\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\line\\plain\\cs20\\f4\\fs24 Irregularity and sclerosis at the greater tuberosity\\plain\\f4\\fs24 , likely representing chronic enthesopathic changes related to rotator cuff tendinopathy.\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:25');
