rinary bladder\\tab :\\tab\\plain\\f2\\fs24 Well opacified . \\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\i bladder wall appears thickened and trabeculated with sacuulations   .an irregular fairly large persistent filling defect is seen along the basal region . Developing slight bilateral  ureteric obstruction  is evident as  slightlt elevation and filling up with mild  dilatation of distal ureters on either sides .\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b\\ul IMPRESSION;  \\par\\par\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\b Findings are consistent with bladde mass .\\par please see the description also\\par\\pard\\s16\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2024-06-12 05:56:26');
