numbers;}\\f2\\fs24\\fbias0\\b0\\i0\\strike0\\ul0\\cf0\\cb0\\fi-360\\li2160}{\\listlevel\\levelnfc23\\leveljc0\\levelfollow1\\levelstartat1\\levelspace0\\levelindent0{\\leveltext\\\'01\\u-3913 ?;}{\\levelnumbers;}\\f2\\fs24\\fbias0\\b0\\i0\\strike0\\ul0\\cf0\\cb0\\fi-360\\li2520}{\\listlevel\\levelnfc23\\leveljc0\\levelfollow1\\levelstartat1\\levelspace0\\levelindent0{\\leveltext\\\'01\\u-3913 ?;}{\\levelnumbers;}\\f2\\fs24\\fbias0\\b0\\i0\\strike0\\ul0\\cf0\\cb0\\fi-360\\li2880}{\\listlevel\\levelnfc23\\leveljc0\\levelfollow1\\levelstartat1\\levelspace0\\levelindent0{\\leveltext\\\'01\\u-3913 ?;}{\\levelnumbers;}\\f2\\fs24\\fbias0\\b0\\i0\\strike0\\ul0\\cf0\\cb0\\fi-360\\li3240}{\\listname ;}\\listid1}}\r\n{\\*\\listoverridetable{\\listoverride\\listid1\\listoverridecount0\\ls1}}\r\n{\\*\\generator TX_RTF32 16.0.533.500;}\r\n\\deftab1134\\paperw12000\\paperh15840\\margl1440\\margt1440\\margr1440\\margb1440\\widowctrl\\formshade\\sectd\r\n\\headery720\\footery720\\pgwsxn12000\\pghsxn15840\\marglsxn1440\\margtsxn1440\\margrsxn1440\\margbsxn1440\\pard\\s20\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb93\\sa186\\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs28  \\plain\\cs18\\f1\\fs28\\i Thoracic Aortic Aneurysm\\plain\\f1\\fs28\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\plain\\f1\\fs24 Look especially at the \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 aortic arch\\plain\\f1\\fs24  and \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 mediastinum\\plain\\f1\\fs24 .\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb73\\sa146\\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs22 A. Widened mediastinum\\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 >8 cm\\plain\\f0\\fs22\\b  on a PA film (measured at the aortic arch level)\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f1\\fs24 The aortic shadow appears broad or bulging\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb73\\sa146\\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs22 B. Prominent or enlarged aortic knob\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f1\\fs24 The \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 aortic arch contour\\plain\\f1\\fs24  appears \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 larger, more rounded, or lobulated\\plain\\f1\\fs24\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}The \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 left upper mediastinal border\\plain\\f1\\fs24  may be \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 outpouching or convex\\plain\\f1\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb73\\sa146\\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs22 C. Loss of normal aortopulmonary window\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f1\\fs24 The normally concave space between the aortic arch and pulmonary artery becomes \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 flat or convex\\plain\\f1\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb73\\sa146\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 Trachea pushed to the right\\plain\\f1\\fs24  due to the dilated arch on the left\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb73\\sa146\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f1\\fs24 Two overlapping contours of the aorta, suggesting aneurysmal dilatation\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb73\\sa146\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 Curvilinear calcification\\plain\\f1\\fs24  seen \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 displaced outward\\plain\\f1\\fs24  from the expected aortic wall \\loch\\f1\\hich\\f1\\u8594 ? indicates \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 chronic aneurysm\\plain\\f1\\fs24\\par\\pard\\s21\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb73\\sa146\\plain\\f1\\fs22\\par{\\pntext\\pard\\plain\\f2\\fs24\\\'b7 }\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\fi-360\\li360\\sb134\\sa134\\tx360\\ls1\\ilvl0{\\*\\pn\\pnlvlblt\\ilvl0\\ls1\\pnstart1\\pnf2\\pnfs24\\pnb0\\pni0\\pnstrike0\\pnulnone\\pncf0\\pncb0{\\pntxtb \\\'b7}}\\plain\\f1\\fs24 In descending thoracic aneurysm \\loch\\f1\\hich\\f1\\u8594 ? \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 bulging of left paravertebral region\\par\\pard\\s19\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\sb134\\sa134\\plain\\f1\\fs24 unfolding \\par\\pard\\itap0\\nowidctlpar\\plain\\f0\\fs24 There is \\plain\\cs17\\f1\\fs24 general enlargement and tortuosity of the thoracic aorta\\plain\\f0\\fs24  (unfolding).\\par\\par }', 'rtf', '[]', 'drrizwana', NULL, 13, '2025-11-04 10:12:05');
